      "damage_bonus": "0",
      "description": "<p>When you <strong>rest</strong> inside a <strong>settlement</strong>, you gain <strong>[SL]</strong> <strong>ingredients</strong> (see Unique Mechanic).</p><p>You may <strong>use an action</strong> and <strong>combine 2 or 3 ingredients</strong> to prepare a <strong>delicacy</strong> (see Unique Mechanic). and <strong>Choose one option:</strong></p><ul><li><strong>you apply its effects</strong> to yourself or an ally you can see;</li><li>or you perform a <strong>free attack</strong> with a weapon you have equipped. This attack deals no damage, but you apply the <strong>delicacy’s</strong> effects to each enemy hit by the attack.</li></ul><p>You may carry up to <strong>10 + [SL × 5]</strong> ingredients, and they will <strong>never spoil</strong> until you use them; if you take this Skill during <strong>character creation</strong>, you begin play with <strong>ten ingredients</strong> with random tastes.</p>",
